  "name": "Discovery (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, and then again every two chemist levels thereafter (up to 18th level), a chemist makes an incredible alchemical discovery. Unless otherwise noted, a chemist cannot select an individual discovery more than once. Some discoveries can only be made if the chemist has met certain prerequisites first, such as uncovering other discoveries. Discoveries that modify bombs marked with an asterisk (*) do not stack. The DC of any saving throw called for by a discovery is equal to 10 + half of the chemist's level + his Intelligence modifier.</p>",
